  "description": "Publish an ASP.NET Core app as a Tor hidden service, and call other .onion services from it. Registers the hidden service over Tor's control port at startup, fixes up host filtering so the .onion Host header is accepted, and provides an HttpClient that only talks to .onion addresses through Tor's SOCKS proxy.",
